    "introduction": "Aya Steinovitz-Koren (Hebrew: איה שטיינוביץ-קורן, often known as simply Aya Koren (Hebrew: איה קורן) (born 27 October 1979) is an Israeli actress and model. She acted in television and film in the early 2000s before becoming a chozer b'teshuvah (returnee to religious observance). She is one of several Tel Aviv actors who have rejected a secular Jewish lifestyle.",
